    "type": "game",
    "name": "Wizard Cats",
    "steam_appid": 3176500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN US ON DISCORD</h1><p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a wizard cat, you must master the arcane arts and become the ultimate wizard. To do that, you'll have to fight your way through endless hordes of little animals. Use portals to hop between levels where other master wizards wait. Collect mystical runes and delve deeper into the arcane arts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/fdb33961b71f5db1c9138458457c26dc.poster.avif?t=1753764509\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/fdb33961b71f5db1c9138458457c26dc.webm?t=1753764509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/fdb33961b71f5db1c9138458457c26dc.mp4?t=1753764509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Spell Array For Every Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft spells by combining up to seven runes together for a near endless amount of spells. Hunt for synergies in Arcana and Power Shards which can be combined with spells to create big damage combos. Every rune is inscribed with their own unique meanings to create spells that are utterly unique. Like a real magic system, the spell engine interprets the player\u2019s incantation on the fly and creates the in-game code to power the spell, meaning that even the creators of the game can\u2019t predict what will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re the first to create a spell your name will be etched into the game\u2019s magic system - so experiment! Anyone who comes across your spell afterward will see you were the first wizard to venture into those mystical arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/f0cc3eb5be11bd233ef3971ecbf74122.poster.avif?t=1753764509\" width=806 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/f0cc3eb5be11bd233ef3971ecbf74122.webm?t=1753764509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/f0cc3eb5be11bd233ef3971ecbf74122.mp4?t=1753764509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Spell Engine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spell engine behind Wizard Cats mimics real magic.\u00a0As a wizard you must wrestle the mystical arts to do your bidding. Use powerful runes to bend the world\u2019s magic to your will, but be careful sometimes it doesn\u2019t behave as expected. Only a true master of the arcane can adapt. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duel Enemy Wizards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As players discover new spells so too does this unlock new spells for the world\u2019s enemy wizards. Mobs have access to the spells created by players, meaning a spell you use against them could come back around. You\u2019ll have to constantly adapt if you want to become the ultimate wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/441090a42eb9ae0d512e6101e94151b8.poster.avif?t=1753764509\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/441090a42eb9ae0d512e6101e94151b8.webm?t=1753764509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/441090a42eb9ae0d512e6101e94151b8.mp4?t=1753764509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Craft limitless spells! Destroy hordes of enemies and duel other master wizards!",
